//! Entries slice 128 — Batch 283 (Plan 287 / Research 320): the graph-level
//! look-ahead fusion shape from the `PrismML` llama.cpp fork. Source:
//! PrismML/llama.cpp (MIT lineage) — commit `e75baeeb24` (#391, bri-prism,
