//! e75baeeb24` read of the vendor clone this session — all five files,
//! every hunk (ggml-cuda.cu, common.cuh, norm.cu, norm.cuh,
//! test-backend-ops.cpp) — verbatim by construction.
//!
//! The fixtures are ORIGINAL minimal Rust reproductions (nothing is
